# 🚩 Challenge: [Perceptron Play 1D Alpha]
![alt text](Perceptron-Play-1D-Alpha.png)
## 📝 Challenge Description

Play with the weight and bias of a 1D perceptron on a number line. Adjust the parameters until every labeled point is classified correctly and you will earn the flag. Connect with netcat:

$ nc chatelaine.cylabacademy.net 28367

Instance
Expires in 3:40
Hints:
1. Start with the POINTS command to see the labeled data you need to classify.

2. SET changes both weight and bias at once; ADJUST lets you nudge them.

3. A 1D perceptron splits the line at a threshold; move the boundary so class 0 points stay on one side and class 1 points on the other.

### Code / Terminal Snippets
```bash
1. nc xebec.cylabacademy.net 28367
```

